sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Consumer namespace
  participant VSO as VSO
  participant Vault as Vault (ok-shared)
  VSO->>Vault: VaultConnection (192.168.100.207:443, SNI, CA)
  VSO->>Vault: VaultAuth (mount kubernetes/CLUSTER, role sa-obs)
  Vault-->>VSO: per-cluster auth token
  VSO->>Vault: read KV secret/CLUSTER/app/...
  Vault-->>VSO: secret data
  VSO->>App: materialise native Secret (refreshAfter 60s)
